&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://javascriptweekly.com/link/185670/rss" style=" color: #3366aa; font-weight: 500;   "&gt;TC39 held its latest meeting last week&lt;/a&gt; – a roundup is due soon.&lt;/p&gt;
